  m_text: '

    Credits:


    ONE MORE ROUND, DARLING!


    GAME DESIGNER

    >
    Ryo


    PROGRAMMERS

    > Alvist Cruise

    > Darren Jonash

    > Kristoforus
    Ray Kidarsa


    2D ARTIST (Rika, UI, Arts)

    > Ryo


    3D ARTIST (Nerf
    Gun, Table, Tea Glass)

    > Andrew Mardjohan


    ANIMATOR (Nerf Gun & Rika)

    >
    Alvist Cruise


    AUDIO & EXTERNAL ASSETS

    > UI & Button SFX Lolurio (lolurio.itch.io)


    >
    Nerf Gun SFX F8 Studios (f8studios.itch.io)


    > Background Music Yukizakura
    (music.yukizakura.net)


    > Rika''s Voice Lines Soundeffect-lab.info


    THANK
    YOU FOR PLAYING!'
