  m_text: 'GUESSING PHASE


    In this phase, one will do the pointing, and one
    will make a guess.


    You will be the pointer if you won the previous phase
    (rock paper scissors) and Rika will be the guesser, vice versa.


    If the
    pointing direction and the guessing direction are the same, then the pointer
    will be the winner and do the shooting in the next phase.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1193909a5239d3b4b9bb5e81236dbc7c, type: 2}
