  m_text: 'ROULETTE PHASE


    In this phase, the game will be like Russian Roullete.


    If
    you were the pointer and won, then you are the one who takes the shot. If you
    were the guesser and lost the game (same direction, then Rika will be the one
    to shoot.


    The one who gets shot will get -1hp and -50 score


