      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'MAIN CONCEPT


    This game has 3 phases, the first is rock paper scissors,
    then the seccond is guessing the direction, and third is playing the roulette.


    Each
    phase has its own timer to speed up the game.


    The game will continue until
    the player''s HP or Rika''s HP (the matcha drink on the table) reaches 0.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
